Interference Observatory

Copyright 2026 Summon Software Labs

Interference Observatory is an open-source, vendor-neutral runtime for measuring, attributing, and explaining cross-workload accelerator interference across shared cache, memory, PCIe, collective, NUMA, and storage resources.

This product is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. See the
LICENSE file in this distribution for the full license text.

Interference Observatory does not collect or transmit any telemetry. All telemetry is
written to local files chosen by the operator and never leaves the machine
running the software.

Interference Observatory accepts contributions from individuals and organizations on the
terms of the Apache License 2.0 without requiring a Contributor License
Agreement (CLA). See CONTRIBUTING.md for contribution guidance.
